<block><txt break.before="1">An Act relating to the liability of employees in
respect of torts committed by them; and to repeal the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Employee&#8217;s Liability
(Indemnification of Employer) Act
1982</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_09659325-5edf-45e3-8eb3-5a2e4428e50e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_5c3f19a9-91ed-4790-b0f5-516994326822"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1991-004"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Employees Liability Act
1991</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d10b61dc-fea9-40dc-9f93-7e0145b19cf4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_999b75fa-40e4-4109-9ecd-99e2c981e61d"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day or days to be
appointed by proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2A">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ae43003c-03eb-48ef-9d04-3a7d96cb01dd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2A"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2A</no><heading guid="_4e11a96a-fcd8-423d-af4f-e43190f36c46"
id="sec.2A-he"><b>Police officers</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the avoidance of doubt, a police officer is
declared to be an employee of the Crown for the purposes of this
Act.</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 2A:</b> Ins 2003 No 74,
Sch 1.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_72078768-07f7-4eb3-9bf6-514553a4d708"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_574cd88a-0b3c-48b9-a6e0-a2686a604512"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Employee not liable where employer also
liable</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ef546289-51a8-41fa-9aa1-7b7e33d4257a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If an employee commits a tort for which his or
her employer is also liable:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5c979d30-1c14-4530-bca2-bddb2d80bfdf" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the employee is not liable to indemnify, or to
pay any contribution to, the employer in respect of the liability incurred by
the employer, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2eb316c0-de08-40d1-b400-406e97a026c3" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the employer is liable to indemnify the employee
in respect of liability incurred by the employee for the tort (unless the
employee is otherwise entitled to an indemnity in respect of that
liability).</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ba4d675c-e28d-4e50-9cfc-5bc3d5d17e26"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Contribution under this section includes
contribution as joint tortfeasor or otherwise.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_659742fe-00ce-484b-b281-c0277cc9c15a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_06bbb5ae-81b0-48f3-af4b-85fc2bec6a14"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Abolition of action against employee for loss of services of
fellow employee (per quod servitium amisit)</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An employee is not liable in tort to his or her
employer merely because the employee has deprived the employer of the services
of any other employee of the employer.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_69be430b-f84a-4d7d-86aa-b45d308f2b18"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_6c97a890-a58c-4a44-9fc2-5a4dd8eccf7a"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Act not to apply to serious misconduct of employee or to
conduct not related to employment</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act does not apply to a tort committed by an
employee if the conduct constituting the tort:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_dae1fcfa-5f25-415b-8279-fd79f2d49b52" id="sec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">was serious and wilful misconduct,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1cffc0f6-08a6-4672-a264-85faba791cda" id="sec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">did not occur in the course of, and did not arise
out of, the employment of the employee.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5d7e2a70-41c1-493a-99c5-3a7bcc3511a4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_f0cb4ae5-3c9a-4d1d-b0c0-aabaa65985ba"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Employer subrogated to rights of employee under insurance
policy</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_db8367dc-7b27-41ef-a571-9a5a4481850c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0635e097-e77a-420d-898f-78f1657701b5" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an employer is proceeded against for the tort of
his or her employee, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6966fcdb-af1c-4bd6-92bd-b6ca3dbbba05" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the employee is entitled under a policy of
insurance to be indemnified in respect of liability that the employee may
incur in respect of that tort,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">the employer is subrogated to the rights of the employee
under that policy in respect of the liability incurred by the employer arising
from the commission of the tort.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8880ab53-7133-4a88-9421-817df7097e20"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, <defterm type="definition"
guid="_f97d6548-f2dd-48d8-882b-54f984a0a7c8"
id="sec.6-def.insurance"><b><i>insurance</i></b></defterm> includes
indemnity.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c66b5a4a-233f-41a5-9b20-c5683fc5e2c0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_3b69738a-7de1-44e6-94f2-106df21a7773"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Act to prevail</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act has effect despite:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c6b9f0fd-d673-40aa-aea5-dbcfcdfc1ae7" id="sec.7-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any other Act or law, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_078c792a-d3bf-4445-a6f6-b9a67d6fa5a7" id="sec.7-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the provisions (express or implied) of any
contract or agreement entered into before or after the commencement of this
section.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cd492e22-fbad-4c02-9ca5-e3a3dd79365b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_dde38333-73d6-4399-8e02-2c57bad9367a"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Act binds Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of Parliament permits, the Crown
in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a103856b-4d5f-49d7-b2b7-bd93fd6a4ac1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_b79485bb-cda6-4179-a89d-de3022166159"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Act to apply to previous or future
liability</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act applies whether the cause of action
concerned arose before, or arises after, the commencement of this
section.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e5a886f4-a461-438f-b6a9-ed187947329c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_dfea8ea7-34a8-467c-aed5-68ea0a3f63b2"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Repeal of <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Employee&#8217;s Liability
(Indemnification of Employer) Act 1982</i></name> No
3</legref></b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Employee&#8217;s Liability
(Indemnification of Employer) Act 1982</i></name></legref> is
repealed.</txt></block></level>
</content>


